// The battle of the CI showcase video (assets/captures/showcase.ron).
//
// Both slots field the battle loadout and attack-move to each other's base. The map is
// point-symmetric about its centre (32, 32) apart from the central plateau, so each player's target
// is the image of the other's under (x, y) -> (63 - x, 63 - y) in cells: the corner of the enemy
// base's ring that faces the map's centre, (52, 52) and (11, 11). The first-free-cell rule of
// AttackMoveToStart would give player 1 the ring's far corner (5, 5) instead, and the two near-tied
// lanes round the central plateau would then not be chosen symmetrically (sc2 pathfinding plan,
// Amendment 5).
// Every identity of the loadout has admitted media (crates/client_diagnostics/tests/
// showcase_storyboard_tests.rs, the_showcase_scenario_fields_only_media_backed_identities).
(
    format_version: 1,
    map: "maps/showcase_canyon.scmap.ron",
    seed: 1592639215,
    players: [
        (player_slot: 0, loadout_slug: "battle_automaton"),
        (player_slot: 1, loadout_slug: "battle_automaton"),
    ],
    initial_orders: [
        AttackMoveToCell(player_slot: 0, cell: (52, 52)),
        AttackMoveToCell(player_slot: 1, cell: (11, 11)),
    ],
)
